            "detailed_description": "Influenced by retro classics Mega Man and Castlevania, Pilli Adventure features the Pilli &amp; Paco as they blast their way through 7 levels of fun, fast paced 2D action based on the Pilli Adventure online comic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome say &quot;hard&quot; we're saying &quot;rewarding!&quot; Why? Because every check point you get, every boss you beat, every accomplishment is earned. You feel like like a superman. This is a game that allows you to brag to your friends if you beat it. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nYes, this is the official Pilli Adventure game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVisit Pilli Adventure to read the comic the game was based on!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeel free to post gameplay, Let's Play, review etc , just let me know.",
